{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/ku9z81","slideIndex":7,"text":"MCP is the open agent-facing interface implemented by the gateway. Scoped tokens identify agents and constrain tool access. The gateway evaluates the buyer mandate, produces signed fixed-price quotes in the synthetic demo, and records decisions in an audit log. Current scope: prototype with mock supplier systems; production rollout would require buyer authentication, a connected order backend, and operational hardening. Sources: apps/mcp/README.md; apps/mcp/src/mcp.ts; apps/mcp/src/tokens.ts; apps/mcp/src/signing.ts; apps/mcp/src/api.ts."}
